cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "imurun - Beginner-Friendly Command-Line Front-End for imuGAP"
abstract: >-
  A lean command-line front-end to the imuGAP model-fitting package. Reads
  model inputs (observations, populations, and locations) from a directory of
  CSV or RDS files or from a single xlsx workbook, validates them against the
  canonical imuGAP schema, runs a fit, and writes the result out. Helper
  functions are exported so they can be used directly from R as well as from
  the bundled command-line script.
type: software
version: "0.1.0"
